{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-96737e8187847b2b","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t---\n2\tepic_id: RHAISTRAT-9013-E006\n3\ttitle: FIPS regression gating CI check for serving-stack builds\n4\tparent_strat: RHAISTRAT-9013\n5\tcomponent: KServe\n6\tteam: RHOAI Serving\n7\ttype: Implementation\n8\tpriority: P1\n9\tdependencies: []\n10\tai_signals:\n11\t  change_specificity: 0\n12\t  pattern_precedent: 1\n13\t  adapter_pattern: 0\n14\t  existing_foundation: 1\n15\t  open_questions: 1\n16\t  external_dependency: 0\n17\t  human_process_gates: 0\n18\t  repo_access: 1\n19\t  architecture_claims: 1\n20\timplementation_type: null\n21\tinvestigation_signals: null\n22\tai_implementability: High\n23\tai_implementability_score: 5\n24\tjira_key: null\n25\tbranch: null\n26\tgated_by: null\n27\tgate_failure_impact: null\n28\t---\n29\t# FIPS regression gating CI check for serving-stack builds\n30\t\n31\t## Description\n32\t\n33\tAdd a gating CI check that fails any serving-stack build which reintroduces non-validated cryptographic\n34\tusage, so the FIPS remediation cannot silently regress. This is pipeline/CI configuration work,\n35\tindependent of the image remediation itself — it configures the build pipelines the serving-stack images\n36\tare built through, including the KServe pipelines and the Platform Operator pipeline once it exists.\n37\t\n38\t## Scope\n39\t\n40\t- Define the detection criterion for non-validated crypto usage in built images (linked cryptographic\n41\t  modules not on the validated-modules list established by the remediation work).\n42\t- Implement the check and wire it as a gating (required) step in the serving-stack build pipelines,\n43\t  covering both the KServe serving-stack builds and the Platform Operator builds.\n44\t- Include a negative test proving the check fails a build that reintroduces a non-validated crypto usage.\n45\t\n46\t## Acceptance Criteria\n47\t\n48\t- A gating check exists in the serving-stack build pipelines that fails any build whose images link\n49\t  non-validated cryptographic modules in the request path.\n50\t- The check is gating (blocks merge/ship), not advisory.\n51\t- Verified by negative test: intentionally reintroducing a non-validated crypto usage into a serving-stack\n52\t  build causes the check to fail that build.\n53\t- The check runs on both KServe and Platform Operator serving-stack builds.\n54\t\n55\t## HLR Traceability\n56\t\n57\t- HLR-3 (P1): CI enforces FIPS regressions — a gating check fails any serving-stack build that\n58\t  reintroduces non-validated crypto usage.\n59\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-988037398ae6e219","agent_id":"a7e929e672b4dfe9b","session_id":"f37d0be2-e15d-4b1a-8282-2b0c8101e79b","uuid":"d06a852f-1dbd-4457-bb8d-7c9c4f382e11","timestamp":"2026-10-23T18:52:28.056Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-96737e8187847b2b","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"claude","task_description":"Review RHAISTRAT-9013 decomposition"}
