ing-stack build pipelines that fails any build whose images link\n49\t  non-validated cryptographic modules in the request path.\n50\t- The check is gating (blocks merge/ship), not advisory.\n51\t- Verified by negative test: intentionally reintroducing a non-validated crypto usage into a serving-stack\n52\t  build causes the check to fail that build.\n53\t- The check runs on both KServe and Platform Operator serving-stack builds.\n54\t\n55\t## HLR Traceability\n56\t\n57\t- HLR-3 (P1): CI enforces FIPS regressions — a gating check fails any serving-stack build that\n58\t  reintroduces non-validated crypto usage.\n59\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-80bad19ec0ec143d","agent_id":"a181dc655b6c27c7e","session_id":"f37d0be2-e15d-4b1a-8282-2b0c8101e79b","uuid":"a7700528-bf13-493a-a2c7-5cc804099f73","timestamp":"2026-10-23T18:57:53.301Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-910a40a17cdcbfe7","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"claude","task_description":"Revise RHAISTRAT-9013 decomposition"}
